---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy — Free Class Schedule Maker"
  description="Privacy policy, GDPR and CCPA disclosures, browser localStorage usage, and Google AdSense cookie transparency for Class Schedule Optimizer."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-10 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 shadow-xs">
        <span>Transparency & Security</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
        Effective Date: October 2026 • Last Updated: Academic Year 2026–2027
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">1. Overview & Client-Side Privacy Commitment</h2>
      <p>
        At <strong>Free Class Schedule Maker</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"), accessible via freeclassschedule.com, we prioritize the absolute privacy and data sovereignty of students and educators. Our tool is architected on a zero-backend model: <em>none of your course codes, class timings, notes, or schedules are ever transmitted to or stored on our servers.</em>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">2. Browser LocalStorage Data Transparency</h2>
      <p>
        To ensure that your work is not lost when you refresh the webpage, our tool utilizes your browser's native <code>localStorage</code> API under the key <code>class_schedule_optimizer_state_v2</code>. This data resides solely on your physical computing device. You may completely purge this data at any moment by clicking the "Reset" button within the scheduler toolbar or by clearing your browser cache.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">3. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Disclosures</h2>
      <p>
        We may display advertisements served by Google AdSense to fund server infrastructure, bandwidth, and ongoing algorithmic research.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites across the Internet.</li>
        <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
        <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Google Ads Settings</a> or by navigating to <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">4. GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation) Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), users are entitled to rights of access, rectification, erasure, and data portability. Because our software executes completely on the client side without storing personally identifiable information (PII) on external databases, you maintain complete autonomous control over your data directly within your web browser.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">5. CCPA (California Consumer Privacy Act) Disclosures</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We do not collect student educational records governed under FERPA (Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act). All timetable generation operations occur strictly in local client memory.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">6. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, contact our designated privacy officer via email at <a href="mailto:privacy@freeclassschedule.com" class="underline text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">privacy@freeclassschedule.com</a> or <a href="mailto:hello@freeclassschedule.com" class="underline text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">hello@freeclassschedule.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

